  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Ecwid (Lightspeed) is a hosted ecommerce widget you embed on an existing website, WordPress, or social storefront rather than replacing the CMS. US tiles after the 2 March 2026 update: Starter $5/mo; Venture $35/mo or $29 annual; Business $65/mo or $49 annual; Unlimited $149/mo or $119 annual. Ecwid does not add its own transaction fee on top of payment processing. Landscape SaaS peer — not a Shopify-class commerce OS. Research grounded 2026-08-18 from first-party pricing; confirm live on ecwid.com/pricing.",
    "bestFor": [
      "SMBs that already have a website and need a cart, not a new CMS",
      "WordPress/Wix/custom sites adding payments without a platform migration",
      "Founders who want a low monthly floor and no platform transaction fee",
      "solo / operations: Ecwid fit for solo operations teams in the saas-platform job cluster, from first-party positioning and Ecommerce Priority-2 research.",
